      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The system release of prazosin confirms the good efficacy and tolerance of Alpress in the hypertension treatment. Prazosin has favorable effects on some risk factors, and it therefore seem interesting to conduct a study in a pannel of hypertensive patients, to emphasize the quality of Alpress response, based on these criteria. This experiment demonstrated the efficacy and tolerance levels of Alpress as well as its favorable effect on cholesterol."},
